OL,3,GNEWSAPensioner, 73, in court over
OL,4,Awoman's murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has appeared in court after being
OL,7,Fcharged with murder following the death
OL,8,Fof a woman in her 70s.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to
OL,11,FSherbourne Avenue in Bradley Stoke on
OL,12,Fthe outskirts of Bristol at about 14:00
OL,13,FBST on Friday.
OL,15,FA 71-year-old woman was found with
OL,16,Fserious injuries and pronounced dead at
OL,17,Fthe scene, police said. Gerald Bishop,
OL,18,Fof Sherbourne Avenue, was later charged
OL,19,Fwith her murder.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
