OL,3,GNEWSAPensioner, 73, in court over
OL,4,Awoman's murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FAppearing at Bristol Magistrates Court
OL,7,Fearlier, the 73-year-old was remanded
OL,8,Finto custody ahead of hearing at
OL,9,FBristol Crown Court on Tuesday.
